  "body": {
    "id": "lem:local-score-extension",
    "kind": "lemma",
    "statement": "Under the constant-rank conditions, \\(\\phi_U^{\\mathrm{loc}}(P;b,P_0)\\in\\mathcal I_b(P)\\) for every \\(P\\in\\mathcal M_b\\) in a neighborhood of \\(P_0\\), and \\(\\phi_U^{\\mathrm{loc}}(P_0;\\mathrm{PT},P_0)=\\phi_U^{\\mathrm{loc}}(P_0;\\mathrm{SC},P_0)=\\phi_U(P_0)\\). Along every \\(((P_n,b_n))\\in\\mathfrak L_U(P_0)\\) for which both chart labels are admissible, the \\(L^2(P_{n,O})\\) distance between the PT and SC extensions is \\(O(n^{-1/2})\\).",
    "free_symbols": [
